You have five minutes.
Make sure to pee off.


00:01:55.023 --> 00:01:59.014
Where is 0864? 0864?


00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:08.005
Did you think we would
drive without you?


00:02:10.001 --> 00:02:15.020
You wouldn't survive an hour out
here. The wolves would eat you alive.


00:02:32.003 --> 00:02:37.022
RUSSIAN PRISON COLONY


00:03:23.015 --> 00:03:28.019
- I hate cellmates.
- Then we already have something in common.


00:03:28.021 --> 00:03:34.011
- The previous one only lasted a month.
- I'll be out again in three days.


00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:37.002
Everyone is here for life.


00:03:37.004 --> 00:03:40.014
One more minute and you'll
have to try to kill me.


00:03:44.008 --> 00:03:45.017
Top.


00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.004
May I sit and eat with you?


00:03:51.006 --> 00:03:53.010
No.


00:04:01.002 --> 00:04:04.005
You are in private territory.


00:04:04.007 --> 00:04:06.015
Fuck me.


00:04:10.011 --> 00:04:14.008
Who the hell do you
think you are, fool?


00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.000
Now it is a free area.


00:04:39.002 --> 00:04:42.003
The boss will talk to you.


00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.020
So you are the one my
people want to get rid of.


00:04:51.022 --> 00:04:54.003
Do you know who I am?


00:04:54.005 --> 00:04:58.007
You are Semyon Chorny,
leader of the Kirov gang.


00:04:58.009 --> 00:05:03.020
Your weapons are killing men, women
and children all over the world.


00:05:04.019 --> 00:05:07.013
So you know who I am.


00:05:07.015 --> 00:05:11.001
Who the hell are you?


00:05:11.003 --> 00:05:15.008
Me? I am a hunter.


00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:21.004
Hunter? So what
are you hunting?


00:05:25.009 --> 00:05:27.016
Men like you.


00:05:28.017 --> 00:05:31.014
The hunter is a myth.


00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:38.014
Now you're in the crosshairs, hunter.
What is your name and who sent you?


00:05:40.005 --> 00:05:42.011
The name is…


00:05:43.008 --> 00:05:44.022
… The collar.


00:05:45.017 --> 00:05:46.023
The collar?


00:05:47.001 --> 00:05:50.001
But you don't tell anyone that.


00:06:03.001 --> 00:06:06.008
All myths have a grain of truth.


00:06:19.014 --> 00:06:22.013
There is a prisoner on the run!


00:06:25.005 --> 00:06:28.008
There's a prisoner on the run!


00:07:00.005 --> 00:07:04.006
Three days! Three days!


00:07:20.022 --> 00:07:22.000
He gets away!


00:08:09.014 --> 00:08:11.008
Easy, easy, easy!


00:08:31.007 --> 00:08:33.008
You were late for it.


00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:36.019
Next time you can escape
from the damper, I will fly.


00:08:36.021 --> 00:08:39.018
Otherwise, thanks.
How did it go?


00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:42.015
As it always goes.


00:08:42.018 --> 00:08:46.018
Good for me, bad for him.


00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.010
There's a body over here.


00:09:07.021 --> 00:09:11.007
- Has he been identified? - No.


00:09:15.009 --> 00:09:18.004
It's prisoner 0864.


00:09:18.022 --> 00:09:22.013
Who the hell was it then
that killed Chornij?


00:09:39.003 --> 00:09:45.003
16 YEARS EARLIER


00:09:49.023 --> 00:09:54.012
BOARDING SCHOOL ST.
MICHAEL'S, NEW YORK


00:09:57.006 --> 00:10:02.002
Kravinoff and Kravinoff, your
father is coming to get you.


00:10:08.005 --> 00:10:10.008
What have you done now?


00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:13.004
Me? Nothing. I
thought it was you.


00:10:13.006 --> 00:10:14.010
No.


00:10:37.003 --> 00:10:39.009
Where are we going, papa?


00:10:39.011 --> 00:10:43.016
It's the middle of a semester.
Mom never did anything like this.


00:10:43.018 --> 00:10:45.009
Sergei…


00:10:47.003 --> 00:10:50.001
Your mother is dead.


00:10:50.003 --> 00:10:56.000
She has taken her own life.
She was weak. Sick in the mind.


00:11:00.011 --> 00:11:05.007
- It was her choice.
- She's dead because you chased her away.


00:11:05.009 --> 00:11:09.008
No. She gave up
a long time ago.


00:11:10.021 --> 00:11:16.007
You hadn't seen her in two years.
It doesn't change anything for you.


00:11:16.009 --> 00:11:21.009
- Not for you either, Dmitri.
- Are we on our way to the funeral now?


00:11:21.011 --> 00:11:26.013
- A suicide does not get that honor.
- So where are you taking us?


00:11:26.015 --> 00:11:28.017
We're going hunting.


00:11:28.019 --> 00:11:32.012
The lion Zar has
been seen again.


00:11:32.014 --> 00:11:35.009
You will benefit
from it, both of you.


00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:40.002
The company of men,
surrounded by nature.


00:11:40.004 --> 00:11:43.005
To shoot to kill.


00:11:43.007 --> 00:11:45.007
Pleasure.


00:11:55.023 --> 00:11:59.009
NORTHERN TANZANIA


00:12:01.023 --> 00:12:06.023
Be careful with them. Put
the cards away, Calypso.


00:12:07.001 --> 00:12:11.020
Your parents will be back soon,
and you know their attitude.


00:12:11.022 --> 00:12:14.008
It's just a game, bestie.


00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:18.013
If you think my cards are
just glossy pictures, -


00:12:18.015 --> 00:12:24.015
then you can think again. They
show us the invisible way.


00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:29.002
Do you think they can
predict the future?


00:12:29.004 --> 00:12:31.005
In the right hands.


00:12:36.016 --> 00:12:39.021
Place three cards.


00:12:39.023 --> 00:12:44.009
- The first card is the subject.
- The high priestess?


00:12:45.012 --> 00:12:48.022
You come from a long
line of strong women.


00:12:49.015 --> 00:12:53.004
Second card is the situation.


00:12:53.006 --> 00:12:58.000
The tower. A terrible
accident is going to happen.


00:13:00.007 --> 00:13:03.004
Third card is the outcome.


00:13:03.006 --> 00:13:08.005
Strength. There is great
danger in that card.


00:13:08.007 --> 00:13:13.010
I have something for you, Calypso. I
would have waited until you were older, -


00:13:13.012 --> 00:13:17.005
but the cards show that
you will need it soon.


00:13:17.007 --> 00:13:20.003
- What is it? - A potion.


00:13:20.005 --> 00:13:25.010
The formula has been passed down
in our family through generations.


00:13:27.004 --> 00:13:31.014
- What does the symbol mean?
- It is the sign of the spirit Papa Legba.


00:13:32.011 --> 00:13:37.006
He opens the gate to the
beyond. Take good care of it.


00:13:37.023 --> 00:13:41.013
It's powerful magic.


00:13:41.015 --> 00:13:47.015
Be safe. It heals anyone who
drinks it in unimaginable ways.


00:13:48.005 --> 00:13:54.001
The time is almost here. You
will know what to do with it.


00:13:54.003 --> 00:13:59.002
Then put them away before
your parents come back.


00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:17.005
Great, Nikolai.


00:14:26.002 --> 00:14:27.015
Sergei.


00:14:34.012 --> 00:14:37.023
Look how beautiful it is.


00:14:40.008 --> 00:14:43.003
You must never fear death.


00:14:43.005 --> 00:14:47.012
They are the prey.
We are the predators.


00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:59.002
Man should be the only
animal that is endangered.


00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:08.011
Dmitri, don't look so weak.


00:15:08.013 --> 00:15:11.009
Be a man.


00:15:14.014 --> 00:15:17.005
- Are you all right? - Yes.


00:15:19.003 --> 00:15:23.001
He shouldn't have
spoken to you like that.


00:15:24.008 --> 00:15:28.010
He's a stupid pig.
I can't change that.


00:15:28.012 --> 00:15:32.018
He will never show me
the respect he shows you.


00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.021
Shall we bet?


00:15:43.004 --> 00:15:45.018
I miss mom.


00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:49.000
I do too, Dima.


00:15:55.003 --> 00:15:58.014
- Is it Czar?
- It's hardly a miss cat.


00:15:58.016 --> 00:16:03.015
Maybe it's Zar's illegitimate
half-brother, like Dmitri.


00:16:03.017 --> 00:16:09.007
Leave the boy alone. He can't
help it, his father chases skirts.


00:16:10.001 --> 00:16:16.001
You can hear when it's Zar. He sounds
like a thunderclap from a mountain top.


00:16:16.014 --> 00:16:21.005
- Have you seen the monster?
- I have seen his handiwork.


00:16:22.012 --> 00:16:27.023
That cat has killed
20, maybe 30 people.


00:16:28.022 --> 00:16:33.005
As long as men like you have
come here to kill lions, -


00:16:33.007 --> 00:16:37.004
have there been legends about
the one who cannot be killed.


00:16:37.006 --> 00:16:42.017
Men like me. But you take
my money anyway, Bahari.


00:16:43.017 --> 00:16:47.000
A lion hunts for food.


00:16:47.002 --> 00:16:49.009
I do the same.


00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:57.016
- Why are you hunting, Nikolai?
- You know that, Bahari.


00:16:59.008 --> 00:17:04.018
A man who kills a legend
becomes a legend himself.


00:17:08.006 --> 00:17:11.007
Nikolai, we need to talk.


00:17:11.009 --> 00:17:13.012
Save on the weather.


00:17:13.015 --> 00:17:19.003
It is a chronic disorder. I just need
to take a break every now and then.


00:17:19.006 --> 00:17:22.003
I always think ahead.


00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:28.017
I will offer you to
become my companion.


00:17:28.019 --> 00:17:31.002
What is your name?


00:17:32.018 --> 00:17:38.013
I am here as Vladimir's
guest. Alexey Sytsevitch.


00:17:38.015 --> 00:17:42.018
No. You have no name.


00:17:44.022 --> 00:17:48.004
In this world you do not exist.


00:17:48.006 --> 00:17:54.006
What does a nameless, nonexistent,
chronically ill clown have to offer Kravinoff?


00:17:55.013 --> 00:17:57.011
Nothing.


00:17:58.006 --> 00:18:04.004
I am here to teach my
sons the joy of the chase.


00:18:04.006 --> 00:18:09.007
And you and your
imbecile voice haunt me.


00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:13.001
So keep quiet.


00:18:21.084 --> 00:18:25.085
- I hope father gets him this time.
- Why?


00:18:25.087 --> 00:18:29.100
Because then he will become a legend, and
then we won't have to come here again.


00:18:31.106 --> 00:18:36.085
A true legend would fight
fair, not with a rifle.


00:18:36.087 --> 00:18:40.087
It has to be one on one with
the tools you were born with.


00:18:47.104 --> 00:18:50.094
Dmitri, about behind me.


00:19:26.103 --> 00:19:29.095
Dmitri, away!


00:19:33.088 --> 00:19:34.102
Run!


00:19:37.091 --> 00:19:38.102
Run!


00:19:48.098 --> 00:19:51.083
Sergei!


00:19:52.096 --> 00:19:55.091
Sergei!


00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:18.093
Calypso, look!


00:20:32.088 --> 00:20:34.103
Now get up, honey.


00:20:37.098 --> 00:20:40.088
Calypso?


00:20:41.085 --> 00:20:43.088
Calypso?


00:20:44.105 --> 00:20:45.106
Calypso!


00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:46.084
By all the gods and all the
riddles of the universe…


00:21:50.086 --> 00:21:51.101
Help!


00:21:55.097 --> 00:21:59.085
… grant me the
power of the earth.


00:22:10.089 --> 00:22:11.105
Wait.


00:22:21.104 --> 00:22:24.101
Grant me the power of heaven.


00:22:32.092 --> 00:22:35.095
All gone. There are collisions.


00:22:40.087 --> 00:22:46.087
We have done everything we could.
The time of death is 06.51.


00:23:19.092 --> 00:23:25.092
The card was found in your
pocket. You are a very lucky boy.


00:23:25.095 --> 00:23:28.088
Thank you for saving me.


00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:32.098
I can't take credit for that.
I wasn't the one who saved you.


00:23:33.101 --> 00:23:37.092
- I don't understand that.
- Then there are two of us.


00:23:37.094 --> 00:23:42.084
But now we are taking some
tests to find out what happened.


00:23:42.086 --> 00:23:44.099
- Sergei. - Dima.


00:23:51.093 --> 00:23:54.085
Why didn't you shoot?


00:23:55.083 --> 00:24:01.083
- They must be Sergei's father, Mr. Kravinoff.
- I've come to pick him up.


00:24:01.087 --> 00:24:07.084
He must stay here and recover. He had
been dead for a good three minutes.


00:24:07.086 --> 00:24:09.096
He's coming with me.


00:24:09.098 --> 00:24:13.103
OUTSIDE LONDON


00:24:24.097 --> 00:24:26.089
Sergei.


00:24:27.084 --> 00:24:30.106
I'm sorry we're not together,
but we will be again soon.


00:24:31.084 --> 00:24:35.100
You know, I didn't want
it to go like this, -


00:24:35.102 --> 00:24:40.083
but your father
gave me no choice.


00:24:41.083 --> 00:24:45.094
You have to promise me
you'll never be like him.


00:24:45.096 --> 00:24:48.102
Sergei, come down here!


00:24:54.088 --> 00:24:58.083
Dad is the only animal
that is endangered.


00:24:58.085 --> 00:25:02.090
- You've gotten too good at that.
- It will probably work.


00:25:02.092 --> 00:25:05.105
You almost had your
brother killed.


00:25:06.083 --> 00:25:10.104
You almost got yourself killed
because you were scared.


00:25:10.106 --> 00:25:14.091
Fear will consume you.


00:25:14.093 --> 00:25:16.104
It makes you weak.


00:25:17.095 --> 00:25:23.095
Are you weak and crazy like
your mother or are you like me?


00:25:23.097 --> 00:25:29.097
Showing weakness to your
enemies gives them an opening.


00:25:31.087 --> 00:25:35.096
You are old enough
to understand this.


00:25:35.098 --> 00:25:39.088
You know my business, right?


00:25:39.090 --> 00:25:42.097
One day you will be
the one to control it.


00:25:42.099 --> 00:25:44.106
Dmitri, go away.


00:25:45.084 --> 00:25:49.092
Dmitri is going back to
school in New York, -


00:25:49.094 --> 00:25:55.094
and you stay here with me. I
think America makes you wimpy.


00:25:56.086 --> 00:26:01.103
It's for your own good.
We all have our own path.


00:26:04.083 --> 00:26:08.102
When you accept who you are, you
gain the strength to step into it.


00:26:11.105 --> 00:26:13.104
Come on.


00:26:13.106 --> 00:26:15.106
Come here.


00:26:19.106 --> 00:26:22.094
I have something for you.


00:26:27.101 --> 00:26:30.103
You never have to
be afraid again.


00:26:42.086 --> 00:26:44.100
He should have killed you!


00:26:45.104 --> 00:26:48.102
What's wrong with you?


00:26:51.092 --> 00:26:53.089
Sergei, come here.


00:26:59.099 --> 00:27:01.101
Are you ok


00:27:36.097 --> 00:27:38.103
PASSPORT


00:28:37.100 --> 00:28:42.099
- You must not leave me with him.
- I'm traveling. I have to.


00:28:42.101 --> 00:28:47.090
- Something has happened to me.
- What are you talking about?


00:28:47.092 --> 00:28:53.084
Do you remember the old camp site where you
could only hear the cicadas and the owls, -


00:28:53.086 --> 00:28:58.097
and where mother sang to us by the
fire? That's all I have after her.


00:28:58.099 --> 00:29:02.099
- That doesn't make it right.
- Think of me there.


00:29:06.093 --> 00:29:09.097
It really hurts me, Dima.


00:29:13.095 --> 00:29:15.097
So go with you.


00:29:17.102 --> 00:29:19.092
Go!


00:29:22.103 --> 00:29:25.093
I'm not going away forever.


00:29:34.085 --> 00:29:36.093
Where are you going?


00:29:36.095 --> 00:29:39.101
Out of England. To Russia.


00:29:39.103 --> 00:29:42.088
On board this?


00:29:42.090 --> 00:29:46.087
You know there are planes and
trains for that purpose, right?


00:29:46.089 --> 00:29:49.098
- Are you on the run? - Yes.


00:29:49.100 --> 00:29:52.098
- I am. - Then come.


00:30:10.094 --> 00:30:15.093
FAR EASTERN RUSSIA


00:32:32.086 --> 00:32:34.097
She was weak.


00:32:34.099 --> 00:32:38.088
- Mentally ill.
- She died because you chased her away.


00:32:38.090 --> 00:32:40.088
Sergei!


00:32:40.090 --> 00:32:41.094
Run!


00:32:42.090 --> 00:32:44.091
Sergei!


00:32:45.098 --> 00:32:50.094
Fear will consume you.
It makes you weak.


00:32:50.096 --> 00:32:53.098
We all have our own path.


00:32:55.093 --> 00:32:58.093
They are the prey.


00:32:59.090 --> 00:33:01.091
We are the predators.


00:34:01.096 --> 00:34:05.101
Only the horns. Leave the rest.


00:34:29.103 --> 00:34:34.097
You don't belong here,
kid. Step home with you.


00:34:38.101 --> 00:34:40.103
I'm at home.


00:34:56.098 --> 00:34:58.103
Is it yours?


00:34:58.106 --> 00:35:03.089
Drop it or you die!


00:36:02.093 --> 00:36:06.099
THE PRESENT TIME


00:36:23.103 --> 00:36:28.085
Welcome home. We stayed
under the radar as usual.


00:36:28.087 --> 00:36:30.095
Call when you need me again.


00:36:56.104 --> 00:36:59.089
NEW MESSAGE


00:36:59.091 --> 00:37:02.086
Sergei, this is your father.


00:37:02.088 --> 00:37:07.093
Come home. i miss you I am sorry
for everything that has happened.


00:37:08.103 --> 00:37:13.088
Shit, it's your brother.
Where have you been?


00:37:16.086 --> 00:37:18.105
Are you still hiding
out in the woods?


00:37:19.083 --> 00:37:23.087
See you for my birthday?
Give me a call.


00:37:50.094 --> 00:37:52.106
Get the crap on the cart.


00:37:53.084 --> 00:37:55.102
So get started!


00:37:57.102 --> 00:38:00.098
Up with them.


00:38:11.087 --> 00:38:14.094
Who is that?


00:38:17.104 --> 00:38:20.085
This is a private area.


00:38:20.087 --> 00:38:24.088
I would like to know if you
intend to lock after yourselves.


00:38:27.087 --> 00:38:29.095
Step with you!


00:38:34.088 --> 00:38:35.106
Move.


00:38:36.084 --> 00:38:40.102
Why do you kill the animals
just to take the horns?


00:38:41.106 --> 00:38:44.092
Because we can.


00:38:46.084 --> 00:38:47.103
Because you can?


00:38:47.105 --> 00:38:51.094
Disappear. We are six to one.


00:38:52.094 --> 00:38:56.089
- There are six of you now.
- I don't have time for this.


00:38:56.091 --> 00:38:58.085
Drive!


00:39:07.093 --> 00:39:09.098
What the hell?


00:39:23.083 --> 00:39:25.089
Run, run!


00:39:48.102 --> 00:39:52.093
DOCKLANDS, LONDON


00:39:55.558 --> 00:39:58.542
Mr. Tagland…


00:39:58.544 --> 00:40:02.551
You must apologize for that. The
man appeared out of the blue.


00:40:03.547 --> 00:40:07.556
A tie-crazy resident
or something.


00:40:07.558 --> 00:40:11.548
But I fixed him. He
never bothers us again.


00:40:15.552 --> 00:40:18.545
Soon nothing will
bother you anymore.


00:40:18.547 --> 00:40:23.546
How are you…? Where
is Mr. Tag country?


00:40:23.548 --> 00:40:26.542
You stand in him.


00:40:28.560 --> 00:40:33.543
This is interesting
reading. You are a poacher.


00:40:33.545 --> 00:40:39.545
Tagland uses poachers, but drugs,
weapons, trafficking are mentioned here...


00:40:40.545 --> 00:40:43.548
- What's your name? - Andre.


00:40:43.550 --> 00:40:46.542
André and what else?


00:40:46.544 --> 00:40:50.561
It is the people in the book that you need
to get hold of. I can find them for you.


00:40:50.563 --> 00:40:53.548
I don't need your help.


00:40:53.550 --> 00:40:57.550
But I am adding the
names to my list.


00:40:57.552 --> 00:40:59.548
André and what else?


00:41:00.557 --> 00:41:02.543
Lavigne.


00:41:03.559 --> 00:41:06.553
You are way down the
hierarchy, André.


00:41:06.555 --> 00:41:08.561
There you were.


00:41:25.555 --> 00:41:28.551
And now for today's headlines.


00:41:28.553 --> 00:41:34.548
State Attorney Samantha Hodges was
shot last week in broad daylight -


00:41:34.550 --> 00:41:40.550
in another brutal attack on
employees of the police and courts.


00:41:40.553 --> 00:41:44.554
The funeral will take
place later today.


00:41:48.562 --> 00:41:52.549
I met Samantha when
I moved to London.


00:41:52.551 --> 00:41:55.556
She was my mentor, -


00:41:55.558 --> 00:41:58.553
a close friend -


00:41:58.555 --> 00:42:04.547
and one of the fiercest champions
of justice in the city's history.


00:42:06.561 --> 00:42:10.543
We all know who is behind this.


00:42:10.545 --> 00:42:14.558
Samantha dared to
defy Semyon Chorny -


00:42:14.560 --> 00:42:17.546
and hold him accountable.


00:42:17.548 --> 00:42:20.547
And the brave act -


00:42:20.549 --> 00:42:22.561
cost her her life.


00:42:25.562 --> 00:42:28.558
The system is broken.


00:42:39.557 --> 00:42:43.558
Condolences. I didn't
mean to startle you.


00:42:43.560 --> 00:42:46.564
- But you did.
- Your loss hurts me.


00:42:47.542 --> 00:42:51.554
- Did you know her well?
- I didn't know her at all.


00:42:52.557 --> 00:42:55.556
Well, thanks for
the condolences.


00:42:57.547 --> 00:42:59.549
Calypso.


00:43:07.549 --> 00:43:10.549
This probably belongs to you.


00:43:15.548 --> 00:43:17.551
You are…


00:43:17.553 --> 00:43:20.544
You are the boy.


00:43:20.546 --> 00:43:23.542
- But you were...
- Yes.


00:43:24.548 --> 00:43:28.546
For three minutes. It had been
forever, had it not been for you.


00:43:28.562 --> 00:43:34.544
It was my grandmother's card.
I still walk around with them.


00:43:35.542 --> 00:43:40.558
- Then why did you give it to me?
- I guess you felt you needed it.


00:43:40.560 --> 00:43:46.551
Did you only have that to
go for? How did you find me?


00:43:46.553 --> 00:43:51.553
- Chasing people up is my speciality.
- Hunting?


00:43:52.551 --> 00:43:56.561
- Do you know who is behind this?
- Yes, I do.


00:43:58.550 --> 00:44:02.546
- Will they hit him?
- Probably not.


00:44:06.558 --> 00:44:10.550
What would you say
if I told you, -


00:44:10.552 --> 00:44:12.564
that I already got that?


00:44:14.555 --> 00:44:18.541
MAJOR CRIMINAL
KILLED IN HIS CELL


00:44:21.550 --> 00:44:25.546
IS
THERE A PATTERN?


00:44:27.551 --> 00:44:30.563
CARTEL LEADER POISONED
ON HIS OWN LIGHT YACHT


00:44:31.541 --> 00:44:34.562
WHO IS THE HUNTER?


00:44:48.557 --> 00:44:53.549
- A tiger's tooth?
- I use what I have at hand.


00:44:53.551 --> 00:44:57.563
- Why did you do that?
- Didn't he murder your friend?


00:44:59.562 --> 00:45:05.554
I have been looking for
you for a very long time.


00:45:05.556 --> 00:45:08.558
It's like thank you
for saving my life.


00:45:08.560 --> 00:45:12.564
I didn't ask you to murder
anyone. I am a lawyer.


00:45:15.542 --> 00:45:17.554
But the pig got
what it deserved.


00:45:21.543 --> 00:45:24.551
I know who your father is.


00:45:24.553 --> 00:45:27.556
Are you like him? A gangster?


00:45:27.558 --> 00:45:29.558
No.


00:45:31.560 --> 00:45:35.561
As a child, I saw my father
spread evil around him.


00:45:35.563 --> 00:45:38.552
He had planned it all.


00:45:38.554 --> 00:45:43.562
I was to follow in his footsteps
and take over the family business.


00:45:45.542 --> 00:45:49.561
But something happened to
me the day you found me.


00:45:49.563 --> 00:45:55.563
Therefore, I traveled as far away
from my father as I possibly could.


00:45:56.544 --> 00:45:59.559
And now I'm doing my best to
eradicate people like him.


00:45:59.561 --> 00:46:02.554
So you're the Hunter?


00:46:02.556 --> 00:46:06.555
It's just something
the press calls me.


00:46:06.557 --> 00:46:10.553
- I prefer Kraven.
- The collar?


00:46:10.555 --> 00:46:15.543
Spelled with a K. But everyone
who heard that name is dead.


00:46:16.541 --> 00:46:21.562
Then I better watch out. Do
you live here in the city?


00:46:21.564 --> 00:46:26.553
I live as far away from here
as you can possibly get.


00:46:28.546 --> 00:46:31.550
But my brother lives here.


00:46:31.552 --> 00:46:33.548
We…


00:46:35.556 --> 00:46:41.556
I wasn't always there for him,
so I visit him when I can.


00:46:41.562 --> 00:46:45.556
What about you? How
did you end up here?


00:46:45.558 --> 00:46:48.558
I don't quite know that.


00:46:50.550 --> 00:46:54.554
My parents were lawyers,
so I became one too.


00:46:54.556 --> 00:46:59.544
I worked at the New York State
Attorney's Office, but couldn't stand it.


00:47:00.542 --> 00:47:03.555
Sometimes the law gets
in the way of justice.


00:47:03.557 --> 00:47:05.555
True enough.


00:47:06.557 --> 00:47:11.556
Here in London, I work for one
of Europe's largest law firms.


00:47:11.558 --> 00:47:16.558
I know that. You are one of
their best investigative lawyers.


00:47:16.560 --> 00:47:22.544
I also know that some of your
clients are not exactly angels.


00:47:22.546 --> 00:47:23.562
True enough.


00:47:25.543 --> 00:47:29.551
So how much do you really
get done from your desk?


00:47:30.545 --> 00:47:34.541
- I keep a list. - A list?


00:47:37.564 --> 00:47:43.544
It can be achieved in other ways,
what you have set out for, Calypso.


00:47:53.546 --> 00:47:57.543
You're going to need a lawyer if
you want to clean up that world.


00:48:00.544 --> 00:48:05.558
How about a partnership? Through your
company you can find them I can't.


00:48:05.560 --> 00:48:08.548
- On the other hand, I can...
- That's understood.


00:48:13.548 --> 00:48:16.564
I'll have to think
about it, Kraven.


00:48:17.561 --> 00:48:22.560
Take well-intentioned advice. If
you go by the names on that list, -


00:48:22.562 --> 00:48:25.564
will it affect those
you care about.


00:48:36.553 --> 00:48:40.542
- Ryazha!
- We have to talk about this.


00:48:40.544 --> 00:48:43.561
Shall we try again? Take it!


00:48:49.543 --> 00:48:51.544
Did you hear what I said?


00:48:51.546 --> 00:48:55.546
Ryazha, bring it.


00:48:55.548 --> 00:48:58.543
Do you want me to beg?


00:48:59.552 --> 00:49:03.543
You know I don't beg.
Do you think I'm weak?


00:49:06.551 --> 00:49:08.558
Then give it to me.


00:49:10.561 --> 00:49:12.556
Ryazha!


00:49:12.558 --> 00:49:17.553
Take it easy. You are
my little Ryazhuska.


00:49:17.555 --> 00:49:20.550
Papa loves you.
Papa forgives you.


00:49:20.552 --> 00:49:22.552
One more thing.


00:49:22.554 --> 00:49:26.559
Semyon Tshorny has been
killed in his prison cell.


00:49:26.561 --> 00:49:31.543
- Who did it?
- They say it was the Hunter.


00:49:31.545 --> 00:49:35.555
Faster than a cheetah,
cunning as a fox.


00:49:35.557 --> 00:49:38.555
More ferocious than a tiger.


00:49:42.554 --> 00:49:47.564
What do you mean? Do you think
the Hunter actually exists?


00:49:48.542 --> 00:49:52.556
Maybe it's just piss and paper.
But he obviously keeps a list.


00:49:52.558 --> 00:49:55.558
And you will never
be deleted from it.


00:49:57.562 --> 00:50:00.544
You are probably standing on it.


00:50:03.558 --> 00:50:07.545
If he is real, he can be found.


00:50:08.548 --> 00:50:10.555
I'm looking into it.


00:50:10.557 --> 00:50:12.548
Wait.


00:50:13.553 --> 00:50:17.543
Tsjornij's activities
must have come into play.


00:50:17.545 --> 00:50:21.559
Arrange a meeting with
his top three henchmen.


00:50:44.549 --> 00:50:48.556
Your boss, Semyon
Chorny, is dead.


00:50:48.558 --> 00:50:53.542
I intend to take over
his transactions.


00:50:53.544 --> 00:50:59.544
One of you must be my companion.
But who? The best pitch wins.


00:51:00.545 --> 00:51:03.558
The so-called "Rhino". He
doesn't look like a rhinoceros.


00:51:03.560 --> 00:51:08.564
Don't you want to know
why they call me Rhino?


00:51:16.543 --> 00:51:20.563
- Why are you putting yourself through that?
- They have to see who they are dealing with.


00:51:33.556 --> 00:51:35.544
Nak him.


00:51:41.555 --> 00:51:45.542
Don't worry, Ryazha.


00:52:23.563 --> 00:52:28.555
Pack away the sliders. I can
get you killed by lifting…


00:52:28.557 --> 00:52:30.561
Don't do it!


00:52:32.551 --> 00:52:38.551
A rhinoceros that sees an
opportunity does not hesitate.


00:52:38.555 --> 00:52:43.559
It rushes forward and takes
it. So now I ask one more time.


00:52:45.553 --> 00:52:48.553
Which of you will
be my companion?


00:52:53.552 --> 00:52:56.552
I call that a pitch.


00:52:58.552 --> 00:53:00.546
The winner has been found.


00:53:49.545 --> 00:53:51.561
My son Dmitri.


00:53:51.563 --> 00:53:55.550
The next one is for you, papa.


00:54:01.562 --> 00:54:05.545
He knows I like Tony Bennett.


00:54:05.547 --> 00:54:09.557
Do you like Tony Bennett? I don't
trust people who don't like him.


00:54:12.543 --> 00:54:17.545
He can impersonate anyone.
He is like a chameleon.


00:54:17.547 --> 00:54:19.559
These assassins…


00:54:19.561 --> 00:54:25.561
When they can hit your boss in
the breech, we're all in danger.


00:54:26.557 --> 00:54:30.551
- Understood. - Come closer.


00:54:31.563 --> 00:54:35.554
Chorniy is dead.


00:54:35.556 --> 00:54:39.550
This makes your
business vulnerable.


00:54:41.543 --> 00:54:44.557
I can offer you
security, distribution -


00:54:44.559 --> 00:54:48.557
and above all peace of mind.


00:54:48.559 --> 00:54:52.554
That sounds good. I'm
on board with that.


00:54:52.556 --> 00:54:56.561
Just like that without further
ado? You don't want to consider it?


00:54:56.563 --> 00:55:00.544
Calm must be restored.
The sooner the better.


00:55:03.546 --> 00:55:08.549
You have already entered
into an agreement. With whom?


00:55:08.551 --> 00:55:11.541
I had to say hello from Rhino.


00:55:42.558 --> 00:55:44.546
Get up.


00:56:01.556 --> 00:56:03.563
You are hurt.


00:56:04.541 --> 00:56:06.560
Are you all right, papa?


00:56:11.561 --> 00:56:14.552
Look what they've
done to my club.


00:56:17.548 --> 00:56:22.550
I am being attacked
on my own territory.


00:56:22.552 --> 00:56:24.564
And who do I have to defend me?


00:56:25.542 --> 00:56:29.555
My son, the piano boxer.


00:56:29.557 --> 00:56:34.545
Come on, hit me! Fight with me!


00:56:34.547 --> 00:56:40.547
I need warriors, not creeps.
You won't even defend yourself.


00:56:47.544 --> 00:56:51.559
The assassination attempt on Kravinoff
failed. All our people were killed.


00:57:01.559 --> 00:57:07.559
Nikolai is a tough old bear. He
doesn't give up without a fight.


00:57:08.545 --> 00:57:11.542
This one was shoved
under my door.


00:57:25.560 --> 00:57:30.548
Is it Kravinoff's son
Sergei who is the Hunter?


00:57:30.550 --> 00:57:33.558
What does "The Collar" mean?


00:57:33.560 --> 00:57:36.564
Apparently that's
what he calls himself.


00:57:37.542 --> 00:57:39.560
That can't be right.


00:57:41.541 --> 00:57:43.554
- Can it? - I don't know.


00:57:44.547 --> 00:57:48.547
Put Foreigner on the
case. He's pretty crazy, -


00:57:48.549 --> 00:57:51.555
but he has been obsessed
with the Hunter for years.


00:57:51.557 --> 00:57:54.561
Maybe he can figure out
what the hell is going on.


00:58:08.547 --> 00:58:10.548
Hey what are you doing


00:58:10.550 --> 00:58:14.564
I'm looking for the prisoner
who killed Semyon Chorny.


00:58:16.556 --> 00:58:18.553
Turn around.


00:58:19.554 --> 00:58:21.546
Turn around.


00:58:23.555 --> 00:58:25.547
You shouldn't be here.


00:58:25.549 --> 00:58:29.563
I am called Foreigner because
no one knows my origin.


00:58:35.557 --> 00:58:37.544
One.


00:58:39.542 --> 00:58:40.556
Thaw.


00:58:42.556 --> 00:58:44.548
Three.


00:59:04.559 --> 00:59:07.546
You must have it.


01:00:23.548 --> 01:00:25.541
Cuckoo!


01:00:25.543 --> 01:00:27.564
My God, Sergei!


01:00:30.543 --> 01:00:33.542
You scared the life out of me.


01:00:33.544 --> 01:00:36.564
Happy birthday, little brother.


01:00:37.542 --> 01:00:39.551
I love you, man.


01:00:41.544 --> 01:00:45.545
- How should we celebrate it?
- Yes, that trick won't work.


01:00:45.547 --> 01:00:48.561
- So let's stay here.
- It's my birthday.


01:00:48.563 --> 01:00:53.557
On your birthday we can
go to the petting zoo, -


01:00:53.559 --> 01:00:56.560
or wherever else you have fun.


01:00:56.562 --> 01:00:59.553
But tonight…


01:00:59.555 --> 01:01:03.564
- This here.
- And do you think I can handle that?


01:01:04.542 --> 01:01:07.558
It's too big for me, so it
should fit you perfectly.


01:01:10.344 --> 01:01:12.354
- Sorry. - Thank you.


01:01:12.356 --> 01:01:17.338
- Nice perfume.
- I'm not wearing perfume now.


01:01:21.336 --> 01:01:23.356
She had found out
sooner or later.


01:01:27.338 --> 01:01:31.341
Papa was sitting right
here. It all went so fast.


01:01:31.343 --> 01:01:36.345
In such a moment you find out
who you are. I'm a cryster.


01:01:36.347 --> 01:01:41.337
Nonsense. It is completely natural
to feel fear. It's an instinct.


01:01:41.339 --> 01:01:45.338
Why can't you choose
who you want to be?


01:01:45.340 --> 01:01:50.348
I will be strong and fearless
and not cower on the ground.


01:01:50.350 --> 01:01:54.342
- Why not just be yourself?
- Because he has to respect me.


01:01:54.344 --> 01:01:57.355
Papa is a criminal. What
is worth his respect?


01:01:58.333 --> 01:02:01.333
You seem like you don't
care what he thinks.


01:02:01.335 --> 01:02:05.354
Like he can't touch you.
He made you hate people.


01:02:05.356 --> 01:02:09.337
I don't hate people.


01:02:09.339 --> 01:02:14.339
I hate what people do,
but I don't hate people.


01:02:14.341 --> 01:02:18.344
So papa was right
about one thing.


01:02:18.346 --> 01:02:21.341
In what?


01:02:21.343 --> 01:02:25.341
Man should be the only
animal that is endangered.


01:02:25.343 --> 01:02:28.344
I'm glad I made it.


01:02:28.346 --> 01:02:33.346
I will not miss the chance
to see both my sons.


01:02:35.341 --> 01:02:36.356
Dmitri.


01:02:38.340 --> 01:02:39.352
To you.


01:02:44.334 --> 01:02:48.354
I don't expect a hug,
but maybe a handshake?


01:02:54.336 --> 01:02:55.345
Dasha.


01:02:59.355 --> 01:03:05.343
I come just to drink a single
toast in honor of Dmitri -


01:03:05.345 --> 01:03:09.341
on his big day. Pour up.


01:03:13.343 --> 01:03:16.340
Serve up to men, not boys.


01:03:24.334 --> 01:03:26.337
Come on, Sergei.


01:03:29.344 --> 01:03:32.333
For the Kravin victims.


01:03:32.335 --> 01:03:35.351
May we one day
forget the past...


01:03:36.352 --> 01:03:41.353
and imagine a future
together as a family.


01:03:41.355 --> 01:03:44.350
Wash zdorovie.


01:03:49.353 --> 01:03:51.345
Such.


01:03:52.356 --> 01:03:55.333
Are you ok


01:03:58.346 --> 01:04:00.347
Sergei…


01:04:02.341 --> 01:04:06.347
I know why you come every year.


01:04:06.349 --> 01:04:10.336
Because you feel bad about, -


01:04:10.338 --> 01:04:13.354
that you left me with him.


01:04:13.356 --> 01:04:16.353
I forgive you…


01:04:20.348 --> 01:04:22.346
… all of it.


01:04:27.335 --> 01:04:29.337
About forgiveness.


01:04:42.348 --> 01:04:45.346
Sergei! Sergei!


01:05:17.341 --> 01:05:20.352
Do you mind holding
the door? Hello?


01:05:27.337 --> 01:05:29.345
Chief, thank you.


01:05:34.337 --> 01:05:38.346
- I tried to hold the door.
- Oh, you didn't.


01:05:38.348 --> 01:05:43.337
This is my travel knife.
It is for work use.


01:05:44.350 --> 01:05:47.338
So what do you work on?


01:05:47.340 --> 01:05:49.340
I hunt…


01:05:51.352 --> 01:05:53.356
… people.


01:05:59.348 --> 01:06:01.339
Dmitry?


01:06:08.346 --> 01:06:10.356
No, let me go!


01:06:37.344 --> 01:06:41.348
Wait, wait, don't! We must be
able to figure something out.


01:06:41.350 --> 01:06:43.352
Stun him.


01:07:01.333 --> 01:07:04.338
There he is. Run away from him.


01:07:05.348 --> 01:07:09.350
Move, dammit!


01:07:35.347 --> 01:07:37.342
Drive!


01:07:41.340 --> 01:07:43.343
Faster!


01:08:08.341 --> 01:08:09.353
Dmitry!


01:08:14.340 --> 01:08:16.351
It is also bulletproof
from the inside!


01:08:25.341 --> 01:08:27.352
Shake him off!


01:09:35.349 --> 01:09:38.334
Go, go!


01:10:21.356 --> 01:10:24.355
Dima!


01:10:26.354 --> 01:10:31.336
- Can I help you with something?
- A towel perhaps.


01:10:39.356 --> 01:10:43.333
I think you forgot your
shoes in the lobby.


01:10:43.335 --> 01:10:47.348
Now I don't think I have.
Not enough volts in it there.


01:10:48.343 --> 01:10:51.336
All right, Brian.
He is my client.


01:10:51.355 --> 01:10:55.355
Damn it, Sergei. I promised
to consider your offer.


01:10:56.333 --> 01:10:59.345
You can't just burst into
my workplace like that.


01:10:59.347 --> 01:11:02.346
- They have taken my brother.
- Who has?


01:11:02.348 --> 01:11:06.338
Four men. They broke
into his apartment.


01:11:06.340 --> 01:11:10.340
- So you saw them?
- I noticed the one.


01:11:10.342 --> 01:11:14.353
Dark hair, brown eyes, scar
under left eye, Turkish accent.


01:11:14.355 --> 01:11:17.337
So you talked to them?


01:11:17.339 --> 01:11:22.352
Not as such, but there was
quite a bit of screaming.


01:11:26.352 --> 01:11:28.341
Okay.


01:11:29.339 --> 01:11:31.344
So let's get started.


01:11:32.355 --> 01:11:36.337
I should have been with him.


01:11:36.339 --> 01:11:41.340
I couldn't sleep, so I got
up and went for a walk.


01:11:41.342 --> 01:11:44.344
We'll probably find him.


01:11:44.346 --> 01:11:46.341
Okay?


01:11:46.343 --> 01:11:50.347
I do what I do
and get us a name.


01:11:50.349 --> 01:11:56.349
And then you do what you
do so we can get him home.


01:11:58.334 --> 01:12:04.333
A mercenary active in London.
Moon-shaped scar under left eye.


01:12:04.335 --> 01:12:09.336
He smokes Turkish cigarettes, so
he is probably Turkish. Find him.


01:12:12.351 --> 01:12:14.339
Sergei.


01:12:14.341 --> 01:12:17.335
- Who are they?
- They didn't say that.


01:12:17.337 --> 01:12:22.338
- But you know that, right?
- The list of my enemies is long.


01:12:25.348 --> 01:12:28.340
Look what they've done to him.


01:12:38.354 --> 01:12:41.335
What do they demand?


01:12:41.337 --> 01:12:45.335
20 million within 48 hours.


01:12:49.334 --> 01:12:50.356
Pay.


01:12:51.334 --> 01:12:55.334
- It's complicated.
- No, it's quite straightforward.


01:12:55.336 --> 01:12:59.347
- You have the money and he is your son.
- It's not about money.


01:12:59.349 --> 01:13:02.340
It's about power.


01:13:04.355 --> 01:13:08.352
If I pay, I'm weak.


01:13:08.354 --> 01:13:14.341
If I show weakness, I lose everything
I have spent my life building.


01:13:14.343 --> 01:13:19.336
What have you built?
You are a drug dealer.


01:13:23.356 --> 01:13:26.337
That's what you're done with.


01:13:27.337 --> 01:13:32.338
Dmitri is innocent. If you let him
die, his blood is on your hands.


01:13:32.340 --> 01:13:35.356
On my hands?


01:13:36.334 --> 01:13:39.336
I have never let him down.


01:13:39.338 --> 01:13:41.355
You let him down.


01:13:42.356 --> 01:13:44.346
You.


01:13:47.341 --> 01:13:52.347
He was dead as soon as they
took him, whether I pay or not.


01:13:54.343 --> 01:13:57.334
You can't know that.


01:13:57.336 --> 01:14:02.349
Yes, I know that. Because that's
what I would have done myself.


01:14:02.351 --> 01:14:05.337
You are disgusting.


01:14:05.339 --> 01:14:10.355
Of course I want him back.
I want both my sons back.


01:14:18.341 --> 01:14:21.338
What a legend you have become.


01:14:24.344 --> 01:14:26.343
Wake up.


01:14:28.333 --> 01:14:32.346
Here, it's antibiotics.
We can't have you die.


01:14:43.337 --> 01:14:46.343
"We can't have you die."


01:14:51.355 --> 01:14:53.346
You are talented.


01:15:22.338 --> 01:15:24.345
Omer Ozdemir.


01:15:24.347 --> 01:15:29.347
He hides in a monastery on
the outskirts of Ankara.


01:15:29.349 --> 01:15:33.356
- You must never call me again.
- We'll see.


01:15:41.345 --> 01:15:42.353
How did it go?


01:15:46.336 --> 01:15:50.335
- She accepted it.
- But did she believe you?


01:15:50.337 --> 01:15:52.353
Yes. She trusts me.


01:15:54.337 --> 01:15:57.345
And therefore I now
want double payment.


01:15:57.347 --> 01:16:01.337
Double? Why not triple?


01:16:01.339 --> 01:16:04.337
What are you up to?


01:16:06.344 --> 01:16:08.338
One.


01:16:10.334 --> 01:16:12.349
Thaw. Three.


01:16:15.347 --> 01:16:17.344
Then it's done.


01:16:28.343 --> 01:16:30.345
Stay ready.


01:16:30.347 --> 01:16:34.335
The hunter is on his way.


01:16:34.350 --> 01:16:38.352
The man you are looking
for is called Ömer Ozdemir.


01:16:38.354 --> 01:16:44.354
His family owns an old monastery in
Turkey. There you can find your brother.


01:16:46.352 --> 01:16:48.353
Thanks for the help.


01:16:48.355 --> 01:16:51.340
Ellie, it's time to leave!


01:16:52.346 --> 01:16:56.333
NORTHERN TURKEY


01:18:57.337 --> 01:18:59.334
It's him.


01:19:19.333 --> 01:19:22.333
He is there.


01:19:27.344 --> 01:19:29.356
Where is Dmitri?


01:19:33.342 --> 01:19:35.340
Where is he?


01:19:35.342 --> 01:19:40.334
If you let me go, you'll never
find your brother, Kraven.


01:20:05.344 --> 01:20:10.353
How do you know my name?
Who has taken my brother?


01:20:12.337 --> 01:20:16.336
Rhino. He has killed us both.


01:20:39.347 --> 01:20:41.353
Who are you?


01:20:41.355 --> 01:20:45.353
Do you have any evidence bags?
I forgot mine in the car.


01:20:45.355 --> 01:20:48.338
What do you have there?


01:20:48.340 --> 01:20:51.340
Crushed paternoster beans.


01:20:52.350 --> 01:20:55.339
The perpetrator has
a sense of poison.


01:20:57.343 --> 01:20:59.342
One.


01:21:00.335 --> 01:21:01.335
Thaw.


01:21:03.340 --> 01:21:05.338
Three.


01:21:07.346 --> 01:21:09.350
What are you doing?


01:21:13.337 --> 01:21:15.337
You must have it.


01:21:21.049 --> 01:21:23.044
It's good then, Ryazha.


01:21:23.046 --> 01:21:27.058
Sorry about that with your finger.
An unfortunate collateral damage.


01:21:28.055 --> 01:21:31.043
Cut him free.


01:21:35.046 --> 01:21:39.059
We have met before. Big game
hunting with your father.


01:21:39.061 --> 01:21:42.056
I don't remember that.


01:21:42.058 --> 01:21:47.064
Understandable. My hairstyle was also
different and you were very young.


01:21:48.042 --> 01:21:49.056
Even…


01:21:51.050 --> 01:21:53.063
… I will never forget it.


01:21:55.046 --> 01:22:01.042
Have you spoken to my
father? Has he agreed to pay?


01:22:01.044 --> 01:22:06.042
No. Nikolai Kravinoff could not
dream of giving 20 million -


01:22:06.044 --> 01:22:08.056
to save his bastard child.


01:22:10.041 --> 01:22:13.041
You're an accident, Dmitri.


01:22:14.055 --> 01:22:17.051
You came into the
world by accident, -


01:22:17.053 --> 01:22:21.052
and you ended up in my
custody by accident.


01:22:21.054 --> 01:22:23.044
Will I then be released?


01:22:23.046 --> 01:22:27.047
Those who abducted you
were not after you.


01:22:27.049 --> 01:22:30.064
- They were after your brother.
- Sergei?


01:22:31.042 --> 01:22:34.063
You both went in, but
when my people arrived, -


01:22:35.041 --> 01:22:39.048
he had disappeared,
as is his wont.


01:22:39.050 --> 01:22:42.054
That's why I took
you. I was lucky.


01:22:42.056 --> 01:22:46.056
What do you want with Sergei?
He never did anything to anyone.


01:22:46.058 --> 01:22:49.060
- You don't know at all?
- What?


01:22:55.056 --> 01:22:59.057
Wait for the end.
That's the best of it.


01:23:07.059 --> 01:23:11.046
THE COLLAR / THE HUNTER


01:23:11.048 --> 01:23:14.062
- "The collar"?
- That's what he calls himself now.


01:23:15.059 --> 01:23:18.051
Do you think Sergei
is the Hunter?


01:23:18.053 --> 01:23:22.057
The hunter is a myth
to scare criminals.


01:23:22.059 --> 01:23:27.053
- You didn't know your brother very well.
- What do you mean by "known"?


01:23:27.055 --> 01:23:32.055
The collar kept a list. Once you
get on it, you'll never get off it.


01:23:39.053 --> 01:23:41.056
That's why I fixed him first.


01:23:52.047 --> 01:23:54.053
I'm filming it right now.


01:23:55.062 --> 01:23:58.053
We hit Kraven.


01:24:00.042 --> 01:24:02.049
I'm not sure about that.


01:24:16.063 --> 01:24:19.061
- Hello?
- Calypso, it was a trap.


01:24:19.063 --> 01:24:23.045
Rhino knows who I am and
he's coming for you now.


01:24:23.047 --> 01:24:26.045
What do you mean? Shit.


01:24:26.047 --> 01:24:29.062
Five suspicious men have
just entered the door.


01:24:29.064 --> 01:24:31.062
Hurry away.


01:24:31.064 --> 01:24:36.047
Go to the goods terminal in Stansted.
I'll get someone to meet you.


01:25:02.063 --> 01:25:06.062
I call it my tote bag.


01:25:06.064 --> 01:25:10.063
It is a mixture of medicines
that keeps my suffering at bay.


01:25:12.045 --> 01:25:16.044
- What's wrong with you?
- I was also underestimated.


01:25:16.046 --> 01:25:20.042
No hospitals could figure
out what was wrong with me.


01:25:20.044 --> 01:25:24.064
I knew I'd never earn
your father's respect -


01:25:25.042 --> 01:25:29.046
or anyone else's,
unless I became strong.


01:25:30.053 --> 01:25:32.056
I tried everything.


01:25:32.058 --> 01:25:34.058
But then…


01:25:36.044 --> 01:25:39.061
… I found one in New York.


01:25:41.047 --> 01:25:45.050
Biochemist Professor
Miles Warren.


01:25:45.052 --> 01:25:48.060
He was working on a treatment, -


01:25:48.062 --> 01:25:52.059
that could increase a
person's strength tenfold.


01:25:54.059 --> 01:25:57.055
I signed up immediately.


01:26:02.054 --> 01:26:05.061
My skin started to harden.


01:26:05.063 --> 01:26:08.049
I became -


01:26:08.051 --> 01:26:12.064
indestructible as a rhinoceros.


01:26:14.048 --> 01:26:17.041
But the pain…


01:26:19.050 --> 01:26:21.054
… was too violent.


01:26:40.054 --> 01:26:46.050
I believe we each have
an inner animal, Dmitri.


01:26:46.052 --> 01:26:52.048
I will take over your father's
territory and you will be my companion.


01:26:52.050 --> 01:26:58.041
The name Kravinoff still opens doors
and you will be recognized as deserved.


01:26:59.061 --> 01:27:02.056
You are right.


01:27:02.058 --> 01:27:06.050
I have been underestimated -


01:27:06.052 --> 01:27:08.056
all my life.


01:27:13.049 --> 01:27:17.053
But if you think I will
betray my family, -


01:27:17.055 --> 01:27:19.060
then you are wrong.


01:27:27.052 --> 01:27:32.056
Boss, we haven't heard from the
boys. I can't get hold of them.


01:27:37.060 --> 01:27:39.055
The collar is alive.


01:27:39.057 --> 01:27:41.042
Bert!


01:27:43.050 --> 01:27:46.056
Team Alfa and Team Bravo...


01:27:46.058 --> 01:27:49.041
He is here.


01:28:33.050 --> 01:28:39.044
Sweet. I wonder if that trick still
works when I poke my eyes out at you?


01:28:40.042 --> 01:28:41.057
Relax.


01:28:54.044 --> 01:28:56.052
Sorry to mess you up on this.


01:28:56.054 --> 01:28:59.048
- Anything new about Dmitri?
- No.


01:28:59.050 --> 01:29:03.049
Three of my sources have disappeared
trying to track Rhino's plane.


01:29:03.051 --> 01:29:07.041
I absolutely do not like it.


01:29:08.052 --> 01:29:12.062
- What kind of place is this?
- The area belonged to my mother's family.


01:29:14.046 --> 01:29:17.051
That's the only thing I
really have after her.


01:29:22.041 --> 01:29:26.057
- What is going on now?
- We are being hunted.


01:29:26.059 --> 01:29:28.055
By whom?


01:29:51.045 --> 01:29:56.060
Don't chase me! You just go
crazy. Show what you're good at.


01:30:06.051 --> 01:30:11.047
I've followed her since she was young,
but she's a bit bigger than I remember.


01:30:12.041 --> 01:30:14.057
You're crazy. Seriously.


01:30:14.059 --> 01:30:17.045
Did you just find out now?


01:30:17.063 --> 01:30:21.056
I know, I put you
on the case myself.


01:30:21.058 --> 01:30:25.049
But why are you so
obsessed with Kraven?


01:30:25.051 --> 01:30:30.057
My mentor was one of the world's best
assassins. He taught me everything.


01:30:30.059 --> 01:30:33.049
He was like a brother to me.


01:30:33.051 --> 01:30:36.053
- Did you know him?
- I knew about him.


01:30:39.051 --> 01:30:44.043
He was murdered. Someone
slipped in and cut his throat.


01:30:44.045 --> 01:30:45.064
The collar?


01:30:47.057 --> 01:30:52.059
So I traveled the world
following his heels.


01:30:52.061 --> 01:30:58.048
But the Kraven is the perfect
predator. He has no known weaknesses.


01:31:01.051 --> 01:31:03.049
But you have found one.


01:31:04.057 --> 01:31:08.063
- And I know how we use it.
- Now, get the hell to the point.


01:31:12.048 --> 01:31:17.050
It is East Siberian paternoster
beans, a rare plant.


01:31:17.052 --> 01:31:20.053
I found traces of
them in the monastery.


01:31:20.055 --> 01:31:26.048
The beans only grow in one
specific region in Siberia.


01:31:26.050 --> 01:31:29.051
That's where he is.


01:31:58.061 --> 01:32:00.057
Careful with that one.


01:32:02.045 --> 01:32:08.045
I'm actually quite firm with such a
one. I learned archery at a summer camp.


01:32:10.045 --> 01:32:12.049
Brown root.


01:32:13.041 --> 01:32:16.061
Feverfew liquorice.
Maltese cross.


01:32:19.050 --> 01:32:23.060
- Paternoster beans?
- You know your stuff.


01:32:23.062 --> 01:32:26.053
- You can die from them.
- Or be saved by.


01:32:26.055 --> 01:32:31.056
- Nature is beautifully arranged.
- What are you doing here?


01:32:35.041 --> 01:32:37.063
Tell me about this one.


01:32:38.041 --> 01:32:42.063
It was my grandmother's. We
were visiting her that day.


01:32:43.041 --> 01:32:46.064
I have spent years
analyzing the content.


01:32:47.059 --> 01:32:52.051
My grandmother was
something of a mystic.


01:32:52.053 --> 01:32:54.063
She had the strangest things.


01:32:55.059 --> 01:33:01.055
My parents didn't like to talk about
it, but she was a very powerful woman.


01:33:01.057 --> 01:33:07.057
She said it would heal whoever
drank it in unimaginable ways.


01:33:07.062 --> 01:33:12.051
I was only a child. I had no idea
what effect it would actually have.


01:33:12.053 --> 01:33:15.058
- It saved my life. - Did it?


01:33:15.060 --> 01:33:18.054
- It changed me. - Exactly.


01:33:19.056 --> 01:33:22.041
Look what you've become.


01:33:24.062 --> 01:33:28.054
I need to know what was in it.


01:33:30.057 --> 01:33:34.047
- And can you get more? - No.


01:33:36.042 --> 01:33:39.044
She died shortly
after our visit.


01:33:46.060 --> 01:33:52.057
One of my sources says Rhino is
moving. We'll hear more soon.


01:33:52.059 --> 01:33:55.056
I knew you'd be good at this.


01:33:57.051 --> 01:34:03.051
Sergei, we're supposed to save Dmitri,
but is all this worth the price?


01:34:03.062 --> 01:34:08.055
Calypso, I was made for this.


01:34:08.057 --> 01:34:12.058
I am the best hunter in the
world. It is undeniable.


01:34:12.060 --> 01:34:18.060
I can find anyone and no one
can touch me. Why should I stop?


01:34:19.048 --> 01:34:22.064
It is called karma. She
catches up with one.


01:34:23.042 --> 01:34:26.062
Not me. I'm faster than her.


01:34:30.045 --> 01:34:33.052
But Dmitri wasn't.


01:34:42.047 --> 01:34:46.057
- Interesting weapon.
- No shooter can kill Kraven.


01:34:46.059 --> 01:34:51.060
The poison here was developed
by MI6 and is highly effective.


01:34:51.062 --> 01:34:53.060
May I?


01:34:58.046 --> 01:35:02.061
It conjures up one's worst nightmares
before paralyzing one's internal organs -


01:35:02.063 --> 01:35:06.043
and results in a gruesome death.


01:35:07.047 --> 01:35:09.056
You have good style.


01:35:19.064 --> 01:35:23.045
Only one person has my number.


01:35:23.047 --> 01:35:25.044
Dima, where are you?


01:35:25.046 --> 01:35:29.046
- Sergei, they forced me to call.
- Dmitri?


01:35:29.048 --> 01:35:32.054
No, but now you know he's alive.


01:35:32.056 --> 01:35:37.056
- What is it you want?
- A life without anyone on the heels.


01:35:37.058 --> 01:35:42.048
You have two options. I know you
hate your father just like I do.


01:35:42.050 --> 01:35:46.043
Therefore, you and I should -


01:35:46.045 --> 01:35:50.063
and young Dmitri collaboration.
You can become my companions.


01:35:51.041 --> 01:35:53.053
Or I can kill you...


01:35:59.052 --> 01:36:03.050
Good then. Then we
hunt the Hunter.


01:36:20.054 --> 01:36:25.050
Divide yourselves,
and get me his corpse.


01:36:25.052 --> 01:36:27.052
Otherwise you shall
not come back.


01:36:47.041 --> 01:36:48.059
Ryazha.


01:36:53.045 --> 01:36:55.051
Where is he?


01:36:55.053 --> 01:36:56.059
He is here.


01:38:06.063 --> 01:38:09.064
Amateurs. How embarrassing.


01:38:11.050 --> 01:38:13.045
Do it.


01:38:14.060 --> 01:38:16.063
Be safe.


01:38:25.061 --> 01:38:27.063
There are explosions.


01:38:28.058 --> 01:38:31.046
It's just a lie.


01:39:16.046 --> 01:39:19.060
The spiders!


01:39:35.047 --> 01:39:39.052
The hallucinations are
just the beginning.


01:39:39.054 --> 01:39:43.051
Experiencing your
worst nightmares?


01:39:44.050 --> 01:39:45.050
One.


01:39:47.045 --> 01:39:48.045
Thaw.


01:39:50.056 --> 01:39:51.056
Three.


01:39:57.050 --> 01:40:00.053
When the poison reaches
your spinal cord, -


01:40:00.055 --> 01:40:05.044
you lose all motor functions.
Then you will suffocate.


01:40:05.063 --> 01:40:09.044
So you are the legend.


01:40:09.046 --> 01:40:10.053
The myth.


01:40:13.054 --> 01:40:16.061
But now you're just human.


01:40:53.044 --> 01:40:55.053
Give him a plane, Kraven.


01:41:10.049 --> 01:41:14.045
I honestly thought it
would be more difficult.


01:41:16.045 --> 01:41:19.053
It's over. But the
brother is still at large.


01:41:19.055 --> 01:41:22.045
- Find him. - Come on.


01:41:24.063 --> 01:41:25.063
One.


01:41:27.042 --> 01:41:28.042
Thaw.


01:41:31.049 --> 01:41:32.057
Three, bean head.


01:41:32.059 --> 01:41:35.056
Farewell to Kraven the Hunter.


01:41:40.045 --> 01:41:41.054
Sergei!


01:41:45.055 --> 01:41:49.041
Nothing just works
out for you, huh?


01:42:12.061 --> 01:42:17.054
Legends don't die.
So get up, Kraven.


01:42:33.059 --> 01:42:36.046
I knew you had more.


01:42:36.048 --> 01:42:42.045
I didn't dare trust a madman
with my family's greatest secret.


01:42:43.048 --> 01:42:46.044
- Up with you. - Okay.


01:42:49.059 --> 01:42:52.051
It must have been
something of a summer camp.


01:42:52.053 --> 01:42:57.059
You are not alone in having
secrets. I will never regret this.


01:43:07.050 --> 01:43:10.055
It's over. The collar is dead.


01:43:17.050 --> 01:43:19.063
What a day.


01:43:25.054 --> 01:43:27.059
Get him in the car.


01:43:27.061 --> 01:43:32.051
Perhaps Nikolai will cash out now
that he only has one son left.


01:43:51.542 --> 01:43:55.560
Are any of you seeing
the same thing as me?


01:44:56.548 --> 01:44:58.546
The collar!


01:45:09.553 --> 01:45:11.544
You're heavy enough.


01:45:54.542 --> 01:45:55.549
Sergei…


01:46:58.549 --> 01:47:01.557
My father was right
about one thing.


01:47:01.559 --> 01:47:04.542
You are a zero.


01:48:06.562 --> 01:48:10.558
The video recording of me.
Where did you get it from?


01:48:12.548 --> 01:48:15.547
Who sent it to you?


01:48:15.549 --> 01:48:20.542
How is it that the mighty
Hunter cannot see, -


01:48:20.544 --> 01:48:25.541
what has been right
under his nose all along?


01:48:36.548 --> 01:48:38.543
No.


01:48:39.542 --> 01:48:43.551
- He deserves to die.
- He will get to that too.


01:48:43.553 --> 01:48:46.545
But it's not you.


01:48:59.549 --> 01:49:01.547
I would wish…


01:49:02.553 --> 01:49:05.557
I wish I had never met -


01:49:05.559 --> 01:49:08.554
you Kravinoffer.


01:49:20.545 --> 01:49:25.541
NORTHERN RUSSIA


01:49:47.563 --> 01:49:50.558
Sergei. How did you find me?


01:49:52.547 --> 01:49:54.561
I am a hunter.


01:49:54.563 --> 01:49:58.553
That's what we do.


01:50:01.546 --> 01:50:06.554
You were the one who sent the
recording. You told Rhino who I was.


01:50:08.553 --> 01:50:13.561
Did you really think a father wouldn't
recognize his son's handiwork?


01:50:14.559 --> 01:50:20.559
An assassin who uses all the
methods of jungle animals?


01:50:22.541 --> 01:50:27.556
You, if anyone, should be able to
appreciate the beauty of the trap I laid.


01:50:31.561 --> 01:50:37.561
Rhino wanted to hit you, but you weren't
strong enough to defeat him yourself.


01:50:38.542 --> 01:50:40.549
Precise.


01:50:40.551 --> 01:50:45.550
But my son, my real son, Kraven…


01:50:47.541 --> 01:50:50.541
There is no one stronger.


01:50:50.543 --> 01:50:55.547
And I knew you wouldn't
take him down for my sake.


01:50:57.548 --> 01:51:00.549
That's why I sent him for you.


01:51:00.551 --> 01:51:02.550
What a trap.


01:51:05.548 --> 01:51:08.556
Dmitri could have been killed,
but everything has a price.


01:51:08.558 --> 01:51:12.553
No, no, no. I knew...


01:51:12.555 --> 01:51:17.563
that you would never let anything
happen to our precious Dmitri.


01:51:18.541 --> 01:51:20.548
Our empire is secured.


01:51:20.550 --> 01:51:23.563
So what now? Should we just…


01:51:25.557 --> 01:51:30.553
… forget the past and
imagine a future together?


01:51:32.543 --> 01:51:34.556
Like a family.


01:51:48.548 --> 01:51:51.558
Sergei, where are you going?


01:51:57.547 --> 01:52:00.548
I could have killed you -


01:52:00.550 --> 01:52:02.564
many years ago.


01:52:03.542 --> 01:52:06.541
But I didn't.


01:52:06.543 --> 01:52:11.558
Despite all that you've done
and all the pain you've caused…


01:52:13.553 --> 01:52:15.548
… then you were my father.


01:52:16.562 --> 01:52:21.543
I still am. Sit down.


01:52:34.556 --> 01:52:37.553
"Never fear death."


01:52:38.547 --> 01:52:40.558
Isn't that what you taught me?


01:53:19.549 --> 01:53:25.549
A YEAR LATER


01:53:56.563 --> 01:54:00.550
- Happy birthday, Dima.
- It's a happy day.


01:54:02.549 --> 01:54:07.560
The first in a long time. And
it's thanks to you, Sergei.


01:54:07.562 --> 01:54:11.562
Or rather the collar. What shall
I call you? Mr. The collar?


01:54:11.564 --> 01:54:15.563
- You know who I am. - I do.


01:54:17.557 --> 01:54:22.546
It was hell I went through.


01:54:22.548 --> 01:54:26.553
But it was also liberating.


01:54:26.555 --> 01:54:30.544
I feel almost reborn.


01:54:31.554 --> 01:54:37.548
I found a doctor in New York. He
was probably a bit unorthodox...


01:54:39.555 --> 01:54:45.555
… but he has really helped
me. He has changed me.


01:54:46.562 --> 01:54:50.547
- How so? - Just a moment.


01:54:58.543 --> 01:55:02.557
- Have you made friends in the mafia?
- I do business with many people.


01:55:02.559 --> 01:55:07.556
- You didn't want to sell father's business?
- I changed my mind.


01:55:07.558 --> 01:55:12.551
I didn't save you from the scissors
so that you would be like a father.


01:55:12.553 --> 01:55:16.553
It was your fault I was in trouble.
It is you who is like a father.


01:55:16.555 --> 01:55:22.543
I'm not like him at all. I have
a codex. I'm better than him.


01:55:22.545 --> 01:55:25.552
You are no better than
him. You are worse.


01:55:26.553 --> 01:55:30.546
How did you say papa died?


01:55:30.548 --> 01:55:36.547
Was it in a hunting
accident? Stop lying to me.


01:55:36.549 --> 01:55:40.563
You imagine that you are
noble. That you live by a code.


01:55:42.541 --> 01:55:44.548
Not a shit.


01:55:44.550 --> 01:55:49.562
You are also just a man
in pursuit of trophies.


01:56:03.545 --> 01:56:04.551
Dmitri…


01:56:12.550 --> 01:56:16.551
You should see the
look on your own face.


01:56:28.563 --> 01:56:30.561
Dmitri…


01:56:30.563 --> 01:56:34.553
You know me. I have
always been a chameleon.


01:56:36.549 --> 01:56:41.563
- That's the only thing I'm good at.
- What has that doctor done to you?


01:56:42.541 --> 01:56:45.557
You want me to be weak
so you can be strong.


01:56:45.559 --> 01:56:50.543
But now I am also
strong. I can be anyone.


01:56:50.545 --> 01:56:56.545
Rhino is dead and father is dead.
It's all there for the picking.


01:56:58.546 --> 01:57:01.546
And I'm going to pick it.


01:57:04.561 --> 01:57:08.544
I can't let you do that.


01:57:11.547 --> 01:57:13.555
Go home, Kraven.


01:57:17.564 --> 01:57:20.552
Dad left something for you.


01:57:53.481 --> 01:57:58.458
Sergei, we all
have our own path.


01:57:59.469 --> 01:58:04.461
Accepting who you are gives you
the strength to step into it.


01:58:05.474 --> 01:58:10.467
You are more than my
child. You are me…


01:58:12.477 --> 01:58:15.461
… and I am you.


01:58:20.465 --> 01:58:23.464
We are hunters.


01:58:24.462 --> 01:58:27.473
The biggest in the world ever.


01:58:28.697 --> 01:58:34.697
 Subtitles By: TearsHD

